WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.813 --> 00:00:06.038
Hove looks fine. The lifetime rating is 4.4.

2
00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:14.645
But the lifetime number cannot move. The last thirty days can.

3
00:00:14.645 --> 00:00:19.631
Two of the last ten reviews name Brighton as the standard.

4
00:00:22.036 --> 00:00:32.565
So the plan is about one branch, not the brand.

5
00:00:34.973 --> 00:00:49.114
The recent window is the number to watch.
